            <fullName>Approve_or_Reject_Claims_by_Claim_Number_179ak0000030G1R</fullName>
            <description>Use this action to approve or reject claims using their claim numbers.

Inputs:
- claimNumbers: A list of claim numbers (e.g., WC-123, WC-456)
- action: Specify whether to &quot;approve&quot; or &quot;reject&quot; the claims
- approvedAmount: Required only when approving claims

Behavior:
- If action is &quot;approve&quot;:
  - The claim status is updated to &quot;Approved&quot;
  - The approved amount is set on the claim
- If action is &quot;reject&quot;:
  - The claim status is updated to &quot;Rejected&quot;
  - Any existing approved amount is cleared

Rules:
- Always ensure claim numbers are provided
- Ask the user for approved amount if approving and amount is missing
- Do not ask for amount when rejecting
- Confirm user intent before performing bulk actions

Output:
- Returns list of processed claim numbers
- Returns count of updated claims
- Returns a confirmation message</description>
